@title Kitting: the Reports menu and the command search find the kitting list
@area Reports
# Reports > Export > Export kitting list (PDF) and Ctrl+K "kitting" reach the same command.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 30
click_text Reports
wait 5
shot reports-menu
check_layout
key Escape
wait 3
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text kitting
wait 8
shot palette
expect "Export kitting list (PDF)"
check_layout
key Escape
